Package: market-sync
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6, python3-requests, libnotify-bin, libxcb-cursor0
Recommends: pkexec | policykit-1
Maintainer: mahabubaabir <mahabubaabir@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/mahabubaabir/market-sync
Description: Market countdown + economic news in your system tray
 Market Sync shows a live open/close countdown for Sydney, Tokyo, London,
 New York FX and NYSE, a DST-aware market clock next to your local time,
 and the next economic events from the ForexFactory calendar.
 .
 It lives in the system tray (Cinnamon/MATE/Xfce/GNOME), can start silently
 at login, supports one-click self-updates from GitHub releases, and ships
 six themes (system, light, dark, dark purple, mint light, mint dark).
Installed-Size: 512
